      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Confirmed. I deployed webapp-plus with rbacl enabled in tomcat7. I then deployed fcrepo-indexing-triplestore in karaf4 with the appropriate authN configuration values. Upon creating a resource via the HTML interface, the camel route authenticated into fedora and saved the resource triples in fuseki. When I changed the camel/karaf authN parameters to incorrect values, the route encountered an error (as expected).",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
