      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p><a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" class=\"user-hover\" rel=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" data-account-id=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" accountid=\"6089a48d248ef60073948d92\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Unknown</a>, Can you verify that by deploying the fcrepo-camel features into karaf you can get authenticated requests to work against the RBACL version of fcrepo-webapp-plus?</p>",
