      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=6089a48d248ef60073948d92",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>Confirmed. I deployed webapp-plus with rbacl enabled in tomcat7. I then deployed fcrepo-indexing-triplestore in karaf4 with the appropriate authN configuration values. Upon creating a resource via the HTML interface, the camel route authenticated into fedora and saved the resource triples in fuseki. When I changed the camel/karaf authN parameters to incorrect values, the route encountered an error (as expected).</p>",
     "created": "07/Aug/15 10:10 PM",
